 the big circle.</li>\n<li>This is the whole.</li>\n<li>Count 5 of these into the smaller circle.</li>\n<li>This is one part.</li>\n<li>Move the rest of the counters to the other small circle.</li>\n<li>This is the other part.</li>\n<li>Count them to find the missing number.</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "2ZjcK7UoipZM3uinMvwK1", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 425580538, "text": null, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 404, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>Example 2:</h2>\n<p><strong>Working out the missing number 12-?=3</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Count out 12 counters.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>This is the whole.</li>\n<li>Place them in the bigger circle.</li>\n<li>Move counters one at a time into the smaller circle until there are 3 left.</li>\n<li>3 is a part.</li>\n<li>The number you have moved is the other part.</li>\n<li>Count these to find your missing number.</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "7DXCLOPCc4KgTrxB1opzS", "checked": false, "listItem": "